#: bball.cpp:179
msgid ""
"Sorry, the given image could not be loaded. The image will not be changed."
msgstr ""
"Dji rgrete, dji n' a savou tcherdjî l' imådje dinêye. L' imådje ni srè nén "
"candjeye."

#: bball.cpp:212
msgid ""
"Sorry, the given sound could not be loaded. The sound will not be changed."
msgstr ""
"Dji rgrete, dji n' a savou tcherdjî l' son dné. Li son n' serè nén candjî."

